OL,3,GNEWSAMSP considered taking own life
OL,4,Aover chronic pain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MSP has said she considered taking
OL,7,Fher own life after being prescribed
OL,8,Fmedication to treat chronic pain.
OL,10,FCara McKee, the Green MSP for the West
OL,11,Fof Scotland, is preparing to return to
OL,12,FHolyrood next week after undergoing
OL,13,Fbrain surgery for trigeminal neuralgia
OL,14,F- a debilitating condition which
OL,15,Faffects nerves in the face and can
OL,16,Fcause shooting pain.
OL,18,FTalking to the BBC's Scotcast podcast,
OL,19,Fthe mother-of-three said it had taken
OL,20,Falmost 30 years for her to receive a
OL,21,Fdiagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
