OL,3,GNEWSAMSP considered taking own life
OL,4,Aover chronic pain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt first doctors thought it was dental
OL,7,Fpain and she was sent to a dentist to
OL,8,Fget a tooth out. She was also
OL,9,Fprescribed different types of
OL,10,Fmedication.
